    "description": "5-bus test system (final market data since 2026-10-14): modified IEEE 5-bus case for BESS siting with two radial pockets (workflow/summary_2026-10-12_18-47.md). Lines 1-2, 1-3, 1-4, 3-4, 4-5 = IEEE 5-bus table lines 1-2, 2-3, 2-4, 3-4, 4-5 with table buses 1 and 2 relabeled N2 and N1; all reactances from the table (Stagg & El-Abiad; Bhandakkar & Mathew 2018). Wind corridor L12 140 MW, PV corridor L45 120 MW, L13/L14/L34 300 MW. One thermal unit G1 (N1), 600 MW, marginal cost 41 + 0.075 * g EUR/MWh (hub price 52-67 without storage); wind 200 MW (N2), PV 300 MW (N5); peak loads N1 120, N3 180, N4 150, N5 40 MW. Flexible demand (e.g. power-to-heat) N2 10 MW and N5 25 MW, willingness to pay falling linearly from 60 EUR/MWh at 0 MW to 0 at full size (stylized). Hourly shapes: IEEE-9 day, peak 1. Loads, generators, costs, and limits are design choices. Built by scripts/data/build_five_bus.py.",
